OL,3,GNEWSAPlans backed for #25m centre to   
OL,4,Aspeed up scans                         
OL,6,FPlans for a #25m NHS diagnostic centre 
OL,7,Fdesigned to provide quicker access to  
OL,8,Ftests and scans have moved a step      
OL,9,Fcloser after winning council backing.  
OL,11,FThe new Community Diagnostic Centre    
OL,12,Fwill form part of a health and         
OL,13,Fwellbeing campus next to the WV Active 
OL,14,FBilston-Bert Williams leisure centre.  
OL,16,FThe facility is intended to improve    
OL,17,Faccess to scans and diagnostic tests   
OL,18,Ffor patients in Wolverhampton and      
OL,19,FWalsall while helping ease pressure on 
OL,20,Fservices at New Cross Hospital, Cannock
OL,21,FHospital and Walsall Manor Hospital.   
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
